<title>USA: R&amp;G Financial sets initial div $0.0625/shr.</title>
<headline>R&amp;G Financial sets initial div $0.0625/shr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>R&amp;G Financial Corp said Wednesday it had declared an initial quarterly cash dividend of $0.0625 per share, payable November 15, record October 15.</p>
</text>
